        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "While three of the four floors are meant as an assisted living retirement home, the fourth floor is primarily devoted to relatively short term patients needing physiotherapy to recover from accidents and/or surgery.\nFood is a cut above standard institutional fare. Mostly bilingual, the nurses and staff are generally friendly and competent in their work. Activities are planned every day and noted on large white boards on each floor.",
